  ["Matematika||Limit Fungsi||"]: [
    {"question":"Nilai dari \\(\\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x^2-4}{x-2}\\) adalah ....","options":["0","2","4","tidak ada"],"correctIndex":2,"difficulty":"easy","explanation":"Substitusi langsung menghasilkan bentuk 0/0. Faktorkan: \\(\\frac{x^2-4}{x-2} = \\frac{(x-2)(x+2)}{x-2} = x+2\\). Maka \\(\\lim_{x \\to 2} (x+2)=4\\)."},
    {"question":"Nilai dari \\(\\lim_{x \\to 3} (2x+1)\\) adalah ....","options":["5","6","7","8"],"correctIndex":2,"difficulty":"easy","explanation":"Fungsi polinom kontinu, jadi substitusi langsung: \\(2(3)+1=7\\)."},
    {"question":"Nilai dari \\(\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sqrt{x+1}-1}{x}\\) adalah ....","options":["0","1/2","1","2"],"correctIndex":1,"difficulty":"medium","explanation":"Substitusi menghasilkan 0/0. Kalikan dengan sekawan: \\(\\frac{(\\sqrt{x+1}-1)(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)}{x(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x+1}+1}\\). Saat \\(x \\to 0\\), hasilnya \\(\\frac{1}{1+1}=\\frac{1}{2}\\)."},
    {"question":"Nilai dari \\(\\lim_{x \\to 3} \\frac{x^2-2x-3}{x-3}\\) adalah ....","options":["0","3","4","6"],"correctIndex":2,"difficulty":"medium","explanation":"Faktorkan pembilang: \\(x^2-2x-3=(x-3)(x+1)\\). Setelah disederhanakan menjadi \\(x+1\\), sehingga \\(\\lim_{x \\to 3} (x+1)=4\\)."},
    {"question":"Diketahui \\(f(x) = \\begin{cases} x^2-1, & x<2 \\\\ 3, & x=2 \\\\ 2x+1, & x>2 \\end{cases}\\). Nilai \\(\\lim_{x \\to 2} f(x)\\) adalah ....","options":["3","4","5","tidak ada"],"correctIndex":3,"difficulty":"hard","explanation":"Limit kiri: \\(\\lim_{x \\to 2^-} (x^2-1)=3\\). Limit kanan: \\(\\lim_{x \\to 2^+} (2x+1)=5\\). Karena limit kiri dan kanan tidak sama, limit di \\(x=2\\) tidak ada."},
  ],

